Z||000000||sqoach||06-19-2001||03:08 AM||||Ok, so I'm cruising along with a friend and we're just listening to some tunes. Well, there's this car (looked like a ford escort) about 7 or 8 car lengths ahead of me, and I wanted to get in front of him before the road turned into a one lane. Since I'm just cruising at about 35-40, 2000 rpm, I have it in 4th and just give it some gas. I caught up to him, passed him by about a car length, and then the bastard guns it. So I have it floored, not even thinking to downshift into 3rd. (It takes me about a 1/4 mile to get from 40 to 70 (we're also going uphill)) He passes me by the time I reach 65, then I just quit cuz he had me beat and the two-lane merged into one. My friend started laughing at me. He's like, don't you even know how to drive your car? I feel dumb  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><P>------------------<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<P>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach2.JPG">   <BR>84 SE (project car?)<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)<BR>86 SC (daily driver)||||reg||9
